.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5.mb-3 How Position edit proposals work
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Draft a proposal from Suggest Edit (or start here).
      %li Edit the summary, level, and assignment links, then submit.
      %li Teammates who can update Positions apply or reject submitted proposals.
      %li Applying updates the live Position (including assignment links). Positions are not versioned like Assignments.
